T-076-2 contract evidence through the real CLI and daemon. Expected answers
come from T-076/spec and controller decision 01. Only typed ContractFailure
instances count as business red; setup/usage/IO failures do not. The
controlled host replaces PTY/process observations, never a gate result.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --source SOURCE
  --output OUTPUT
  --group {red,controls}
  --case {red_manifest_missing,red_base_not_failing,red_candidate_fails,red_rules_failing,red_rules_frozen,red_feedback_idle,red_repair_resubmit,red_review_required,red_terminal_prerequisites,red_run_reject_preserves_worker,red_run_waits_for_executor,control_completion,control_paths,control_frozen_candidate,control_fence,control_stop_without_request,control_relay_invalid,control_relay_duplicate,control_busy_queue}
